//　何か――象徴的な絵画として。
  She takes the cup―it is larger than average―and waits as Doshin fills it from the jug.

  She then lifts it to her lips and tilts it back.

  The audience watches, holding its breath, as Okabe's daughter drains the cup dry. From the lowest scribe to Lord Kuniuji himself, no one can fail to recognize what this is.

  A㉓<I>symbol.</I>㉑ Of what, only time will tell.

