//そういう所こそ手を抜かず仕上げねば全てが
//駄目になってしまうでな……」
"The hardest part was the brow, if you can believe it. Now, that's hidden on stage by the headdress, so you might ask, why bother? But of course, it's those little details that bring the work together."

pt:
//【童心】
